  "details": "Steps to reproduce: Put a negative value into gravity on dynamic bone settings such as in your hair, switch into the avatar in game, and then join a new world and usually the gravity will glitch out and the dynamic bones will be very stiff and won't move around much.\n\nWorkaround: Use negative y values for Force instead of Gravity.",
